  "title": "Nicolaus Copernicus",
  "summary": "Born in Toruń in 1473, Copernicus studied at Kraków and Bologna and from 1510 lived as a canon of the Frombork chapter for the rest of his life. His book De revolutionibus orbium coelestium, printed at Nuremberg in 1543, was in his hands on his deathbed that year.",
